### Comprehensive Audit Fix Sprint — COMPLETE (2026-04-17)
Fixed 9 audit findings across security, reliability, and data integrity:

| # | Finding | Severity | Fix |
|---|---------|----------|-----|
| F-01 | Cache invalidation inside Prisma transaction | HIGH | Moved updateTag/invalidateNamespace AFTER transaction commit |
| F-02 | behavior/insights API no rate limiting | HIGH | Wrapped with `withRateLimited` (60/min) |
| F-03 | team/accept-invitation no rate limiting (brute-force risk) | HIGH | Wrapped with `withRateLimited` (20/min) |
| F-04 | teams/[id]/analytics no rate limiting | HIGH | Wrapped GET (60/min) + PUT (30/min) |
| F-07 | No Prisma transaction retry config | MED | Added `transactionOptions: { maxWait: 5000, timeout: 10000 }` |
| F-08 | layouts.ts null propagation to Prisma where clause | MED | Early return null when findFirst returns no version |
| F-09 | Admin propfirm edit no try/catch | MED | Wrapped Prisma query, falls back to buildFallbackFirm |
| F-10 | whop/checkout + checkout-team no rate limiting | MED | Wrapped POST+GET (20/min each) |
| F-11 | trader-profile/benchmark no rate limiting | MED | Wrapped GET (60/min) |

Additional fixes:
- `server/teams.ts`: early return `[]` when user has no email (was silently querying `email: ''`)
- `server/firm-coupons.ts` cached reads: verified admin CRUD already calls `updateTag('firm-coupons')` + `updateTag('prop-firm-{id}')` — F-12 was already fixed
- 6 test files updated for `withRateLimited` signature (NextRequest + ctx)
- 3 test files had missing `createLogger` mock (pre-existing, only broke when cache-service was imported transitively)

